## A camera-facing disk lit head-on, with no imager: the reference image.
## Not third-party; tests/imagerbackground_test.cpp.
Display "imagerbackground_control.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 32 32 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "intensity" [1] "from" [0 0 0] "to" [0 0 1]
Surface "matte" "Kd" [0.4]
Disk 0 1 360
WorldEnd
